  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 15th level, whenever the ethermagus hits and deals damage with his void blade, he may spend 4 EP as an immediate action in order to subject the creature struck to extreme gravity. The target is knocked prone and pinned for rounds equal to the ethermagus’s Charisma modifier with a DC 10 + ½ the ethermagus’s level + his Charisma modifier Fortitude save to negate. Each round, the target may attempt a new saving throw to end the effect immediately. This ability may be used once per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagus#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
